Let me also double check `nvault_get` signature: `native nvault_get(vault, const key[])` returns cell value. `nvault_set(vault, const key[], const value[])`. In the fragment, `nvault_set(g_Vault, fmt("%d", userid), fmt("%d", g_PlayerStats[id]))` — matches signature (3 params). OK.

